        "headline": "Beach Hazards Statement issued November 18 at 8:03PM PST until November 20 at 9:00AM PST by NWS San Diego CA",
        "description": "* WHAT...Surf of 4 to 6 feet. Sets to 8 feet along west-facing\nbeaches expected.\n\n* WHERE...San Diego County Coastal Areas and Orange County\nCoastal Areas.\n\n* WHEN...From 6 AM PST Thursday through Friday morning.\n\n* IMPACTS...Increased risk for rip currents. Areas of coastal\nflooding possible during high tide each morning along\nboardwalks and parking lots.",
